{"id":837,"date":"2025-08-22T10:16:43","date_gmt":"2025-08-22T10:16:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/bombayfoodstuff\/?post_type=product&#038;p=837"},"modified":"2025-08-29T06:19:21","modified_gmt":"2025-08-29T06:19:21","slug":"raisins","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/product\/raisins\/","title":{"rendered":"Raisins"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Raisins<\/b><\/h2>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Raisins<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Botanical Name:<\/b> <i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vitis vinifera<\/span><\/i><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Family Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Vitaceae<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Commercial Part:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Dried fruit (dehydrated grape)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Product Description<\/b><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Raisins are naturally dried or oven-dehydrated grapes, available in varieties such as Thompson Seedless, Sultana, Malaga, and Monukka. With their wrinkled skin and chewy sweetness, raisins are widely used in confectionery, bakery, cereals, and traditional cooking worldwide. Beyond their taste, they are a powerhouse of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, making them both delicious and nourishing.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Applications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Widely used in bakery, sweets, and confectionery<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Added to breakfast cereals, granola, and energy bars<\/span><\/li>\n<li style